cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tome or its code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Tome: a controller-first PDF reader for Steam Deck"
abstract: >-
  Tome is a PDF reader for the Steam Deck's Game Mode that works entirely on the
  controller, with Width, Page, Two-page and Column fits, auto-cropped margins,
  column-by-column reading for two-column papers, and an optional game layer of
  stages, XP, streaks and trophies.
authors:
  - name: "ZgnBhr"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Zgn-Bhr/tome"
url: "https://zgn-bhr.github.io/tome/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.9.0
date-released: "2026-11-28"
keywords:
  - steam-deck
  - steamos
  - pdf-reader
  - controller
  - game-mode
